Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 圣诞快乐 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Merry Christmas. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.63,0:03:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《蝙蝠侠归来》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(高谭市 33年后)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到企鹅了!是人还是谜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguin sighting! Man or myth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是什么? 今天专题... 又见到企鹅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he? Today's edition. Another penguin sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又见到企鹅了!先睹为快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another penguin sighting! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪异企鹅人住在高谭下水道中! 快来看最新目击报导!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguin man living in Gotham's sewers! Read all about the latest sighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请注意 高谭市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have your attention Gotham City?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚点燃圣诞树的时刻已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time for tonight's lighting of the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好看吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半人半企鹅!十分恐怖!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Part man part penguin! All horrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来喔!只要50分钱便能得知真相!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out for only 50 cents! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看看存在于我们脚下的可能危险! 快来看 各位!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read about the possible terror beneath our feet! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来看今天的报导! 看看最新的企鹅怪物目击报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这是人与鸟间的缺失环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing link between man and bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear boy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时看那种垃圾是种消遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes it's a diversion to read such rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但多数时候是浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually it's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你说 今日专题! "企鹅:是人还是谜?"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever. Today's issue! "The Penguin: Man or myth?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,环球报! 在此! 25分钱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Globe! Right here! 25 cents!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唔 这里是有希望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well here's hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带点幸运的话 高谭市可以在几年后过第一个圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With luck Gotham will have its first merry Christmas in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很粗俗 在圣诞季节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel almost vulgar at Yuletide
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提起新发电厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mentioning the new power plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们若要动工兴建 就需要许可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we're to break ground when we must I'll need permits
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法规变通 减税鼓励 那类讨厌的枝微末节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}variances tax incentives. That sort of pesky nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发电厂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯 所有研究均显示 我们的电力足以应付到下世纪中期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Studies show we've enough power to get us into the middle of the next century.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的分析家指的是每年1%的人口成长 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your analysts foresee growth at 1 % per annum. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是成长 是温和膨胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a mild swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个高谭市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Gotham City
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在未来 灯光燃起如一片繁星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the future lit up like a blanket of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却闪灭不定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but blinking on and off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电力低得令人难堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}embarrassingly low on juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我因而畏缩 市长先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cringe Mr. Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 你的任何计划都得循正常管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry any plans must go to the usual committees
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向负责委员会申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the usual channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 更像是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}actually really just more like a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我们未适当训练凯尔小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we haven't properly housebroken Ms. Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她有个优点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the plus column though
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她泡的咖啡非常香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she makes great coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:09:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市长先生 该下去为大众带来喜悦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Mayor. Time to go down and bring joy to the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"事实上 更是个问题"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Actually more of a question."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是愚蠢的笨狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid corn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨狗 笨狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corn dog corn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我光靠许瑞克的员工 便可以取得重选的签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have enough signatures from Shreck employees to warrant a recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是威胁 只是单纯的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a threat just simple numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许 但你没有立场 也没有候选人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. But you sure as hell don't have an issue or a candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢各位女士 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝我们市政府的人和你们所有的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From those of us at City Hall to each and every one of you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假期快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}happy holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚有位不需要多作介绍的人 与我们同在 他对本市贡献良多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have with us a man who needs no introduction he's given us so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请欢迎高谭市的圣诞老人... 麦斯.许瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please welcome Gotham's own Santa Claus Max Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到人事处拿那些合约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up those contracts for Personnel and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再去拿干洗衣物和纸巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pick up the dry cleaning and paper towels .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了我的演讲稿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我教训那个叫什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remind me to take it out on what's-her-name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个低贱的走运笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a poor schmo. Got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回馈你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sue me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若不满意 就告我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I want to give some back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿我能送出的 不只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wish I could hand out more than just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昂贵的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}expensive baubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿我能送出世界和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could hand out world peace
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和无条件的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and unconditional love
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在大蝴蝶结礼盒中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wrapped in a big bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh but you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh but you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在等什么?发出讯号!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for? The signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要大角色! 主导一切的那个家伙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want the big guy! The guy who runs the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许瑞克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得先过我这一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇普 爸 快走!救你自己!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad go! Save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠人先生 你要是再上前一步 我就...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take one step closer Mr. Manbat and I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇!是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或只是"蝙蝠人"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it just "Batman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 任你选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your choice of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常短暂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我生命中的所有男人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like all the men in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么男人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What men?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 还有你 不过你需要治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then again there's you. But you need therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你拯救我们 蝙蝠侠 恐怕马戏团帮又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for saving the day Batman. The Circus Gang is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静观其后吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们差点抓走麦斯.许瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They almost made off with our mover and shaker Max Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那令人难以忍受的混蛋呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is that insufferable son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信你搜寻的字眼是 啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe the word you're looking for is .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 这一切只是个恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually this is all just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家中床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're at home in bed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无比宁静 安适地休息着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heavily sedated resting comfortably
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口吐致癌物而垂将等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dying from the carcinogens you've personally spewed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只因你毕生牟取暴利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a lifetime of profiteering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是悲剧性的讽刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tragic irony
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或诗歌般的正义?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or poetic justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下水道的企鹅人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguin Man of the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的是 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odd as it may seem Max
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我有些共通之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and I have something in common:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都被视同怪物一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both perceived as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个倍受尊敬的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're a well-respected monster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am to date
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 我不以为然 我是个生意人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly I feel that's a bum rap. I'm a businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强硬 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刻薄 也行 但还不足使我成为怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shrewd okay. But that does not make me a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别糗自己了 麦斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't embarrass yourself Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你隐藏 我发掘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you hide I discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弃于马桶中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you put in your toilet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将它保存起来 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I place on my mantle. Get the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么? 打算对我催眠吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that supposed to hypnotize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是要让你头痛欲裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No just give you a splitting headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 大男孩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是空炮弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我大费周章 只为杀你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would I go through all this trouble just to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个全然不同的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an entirely other purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:30.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已在下面太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been down here too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该上升了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for me to ascend
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重新出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to re-emerge
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借着你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your help
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的深谙此道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your know-how
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的机伶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your savvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并非生于下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't born in the sewer you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come from
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且和你一样 我要受到尊重!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like you I want some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到我的基本人权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A recognition of my basic humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But most of all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要藉找到我父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to find out who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来查出我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by finding my parents
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得知我的姓名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iearning my human name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高谭人视为当然的简单事情!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple stuff that the good people of Gotham take for granted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底为何要帮你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly why am I going to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看这里有些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what we have in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些有毒的废水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A batch of toxic waste
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取自你干净的纺织厂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from your clean textile plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种废物 后面有一大池!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a whole lagoon of this crud in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可能来自任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could have come from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明你拥有高谭市 半数易燃建筑的文件呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the documents that prove you own half of the firetraps in Gotham City?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:22:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若有那种文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there were such documents
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我不允许有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's not an admission
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们早就被切碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would've been shredded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许多胶带和一点耐心 情况便截然不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of tape and a little patience make all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的老合伙人... 佛列德.亚特金好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how's Fred Atkins your old partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佛列德?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 佛列德他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred's actually .
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他正在度延长假期 他很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe he's on an extended vacation. He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 麦斯 记得我吗? 我是佛列德的手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiya Max. Remember me? I'm Fred's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要向其它部份的肢体致意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to greet any other body parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember Max
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.73,0:22:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你摒弃的 我珍惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you flush it I flaunt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 企鹅先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what Mr. Penguin sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想 或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能协助你策划一个欢迎返乡的策略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could help orchestrate a "Welcome Home" scenario for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们俩都回到家 或许我们能互相帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we're both back home perhaps we could help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会后悔的 许瑞克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't regret this Mr. Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.77,0:23:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我回来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我忘了 我未婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I forgot. I'm not married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猫咪小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从妳拒绝分享的性胡闹活动归来了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back from more sexual escapades you refuse to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:42.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我爱刺探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I'd ever pry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝妳的晚餐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有人如此可悲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can anyone be so pathetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.57,0:24:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 对妳而言 我是可悲 但我是个上班女郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes to you I seem pathetic but I'm a working girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.82,0:24:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得付房租 妳若能贡献点生活费 而不要开溜就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must pay the rent. Maybe if you chipped in instead of stepping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.49,0:24:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 亲爱的 是妈 只是打电话问候妳一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina dear it's your mother. Just calling to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.17,0:24:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah but .
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.67,0:24:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我很失望 妳不回家过圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm disappointed you're not coming home for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.09,0:24:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和妳讨论 为何妳坚持要在高谭市受折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to discuss why you insist on languishing in Gotham City
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像一些低级秘书一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as some lowly secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是低级助理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lowly assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.43,0:24:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 记得我们的圣诞出游计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina about that Christmas getaway we planned .
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.69,0:24:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将要独自去 萧博士说我需要独处 而非附属品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be going alone. Dr. Shaw says I need to be my own person not an appendage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.95,0:24:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个附属品!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some appendage!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜.凯尔的录音机盛宴永不停息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The party never stops on Selina Kyle's answering machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来上次打板球时 我该让他赢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've let him win that last racquetball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.30,0:24:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:24:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜.凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要告诉妳有种新的高谭女士香水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're calling to tell you about exciting new Gotham Lady perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会使女人感觉像女人 而且男人不会有抱怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes women feel like women and the men have no complaints either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.57,0:25:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 瑟琳娜 这是提醒妳自己　真蠢! 妳得回办公室去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is yourself reminding you to come all the way back to the office
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.53,0:25:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果妳忘记带布鲁斯.韦恩的档案回来 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you forgot the Bruce Wayne file . 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋!　 星期三有个会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid corn dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.81,0:25:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加班吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working late?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.65,0:25:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在帮你预备明早 和布鲁斯.韦恩开会的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just boning up for your Bruce Wayne meeting in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.45,0:25:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我调出发电厂企划案的所有档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled all the files on the proposed power plant
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.45,0:25:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有预备请韦恩先生投资的文件 我甚至打开了保护档...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mr. Wayne's hoped-for investment. I even opened the protected files...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:25:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多勤奋啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How industrious!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳是如何打开保护档的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you open the protected files?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.34,0:26:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能问吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.14,0:26:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你的密码是"Geraldo" 是你吉娃娃的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured your password was "Geraldo " your Chihuahua and it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这实在非常有趣 虽然在技术上有一点难懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all very interesting though a bit on the technical side
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是指发电厂 如何只在名义上是发电厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about how the power plant is a power plant in name only
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而事实上 它将是个大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since in fact it's going to be a big giant
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巨大的 容电器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}big giant capacitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.34,0:26:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不会产生电力 反而会吸收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And instead of generating power it'll be sucking power from
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高谭市的电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham City
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.85,0:26:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且贮存起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and storing it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.02,0:26:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,囤积它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stockpiling it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.07,0:26:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说那是个非常新奇的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is a very novel approach I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳有将此事告诉谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd you say this to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没告诉别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.55,0:27:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇会使猫如何呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did curiosity do to the cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.26,0:27:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个助理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.89,0:27:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是非常好的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a very good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.27,0:27:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too good?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.77,0:27:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.94,0:27:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的秘密 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's our secret. Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能对一个无意义的人如此残忍?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you be so mean to someone so meaningless?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.41,0:27:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这发电厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This power plant
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.41,0:27:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将是我的传家宝 是我遗留下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is my legacy. It's what I leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留给奇普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何事都无法阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing must prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.59,0:27:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 动手吧 恐吓我 欺压我 若能使你觉得强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Intimidate me. Bully me if it makes you feel big.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.97,0:27:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你又不可能杀了我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like you can kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.39,0:27:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 很有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually it's a lot like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.66,0:28:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么一会 你真的吓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a second you really frightened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.09,0:28:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我回来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.57,0:29:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我忘了 我未婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I forgot. I'm not married.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 我是妈 打电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina this is your mother. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.62,0:30:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 我是妈 妳为何没回我电话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina this is your mother. Why haven't you called me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰 瑟琳娜.凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello Selina Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打电话 是想确定妳已试用过高谭女士香水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just calling to make sure you've tried Gotham Lady perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.34,0:30:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在办公室只要喷一下 你老板会要妳下班后留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One whiff of this and your boss will ask you to stay after work
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.80,0:30:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开二人烛光员工会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a candlelight staff meeting for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.68,0:30:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高谭女士香水 许瑞克百货公司仅售\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham Lady perfume. Exclusively at Shreck's department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.04,0:33:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道妳觉得如何 猫咪小姐 但我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about you Miss Kitty but I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.13,0:33:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是棒透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so much yummier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.99,0:34:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再度在你们面前 谴责与我们共存于这城市的紊乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stand before you again to denounce the urban chaos we live with in our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.17,0:34:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它得停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它将停止! 在这应该聚合的时节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to stop! Our community is coming apart
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.05,0:34:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的社区正崩离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a season when it should be coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.43,0:34:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎批评者会怎么说 现在是圣诞时节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what the cynics may say. This is the Christmas season
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.10,0:34:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是愈合的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and should be a healing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.85,0:34:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不只以官员的身份声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say that not only as an official
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.27,0:34:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更以丈夫与父亲的立场说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as a husband and a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的暴行不会再发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night's violence won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.70,0:34:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不擅于言词 因此我只能说"谢了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not good at speeches so I'll just say "Thanks".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.55,0:34:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 是可怕的企鹅人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the hideous Penguin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.38,0:34:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子你带走 但请别伤害我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the baby. Just don't hurt me please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.95,0:35:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是数分钟前在高谭广场 发生的非凡情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the remarkable scene only minutes ago in Gotham Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神秘的企鹅解救市长之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mysterious Penguin saving the life of the mayor's baby
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 并宣布他的存在 - 我要的回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and announcing his presence. - All I want in return
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是想找回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.47,0:36:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出我的父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.34,0:36:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个查出他们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance to find out who they are
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.18,0:36:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进而知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and thusly
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.98,0:36:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.19,0:36:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.81,0:36:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我父母那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my parents
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.98,0:36:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设法了解 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try to understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何他们做出他们觉得非做不可的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why they did what I guess they felt they had to do
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.37,0:36:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a child
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.71,0:36:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个生来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was born
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.38,0:36:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点不同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A child
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.84,0:36:42.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他度过第一个圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who spent his first Christmas
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.35,0:36:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和之后许多个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and many since
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.73,0:36:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在下水道中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.23,0:36:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩先生?有何不对吗? 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.40,0:36:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再度说明 本画面直接拍自高谭广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This scene direct from Gotham Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿他找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope he finds them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.91,0:37:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他正站在高谭市模范市民... 麦斯.许瑞克的旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here he is standing alongside Gotham's leading citizen Max Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.04,0:37:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说句话好吗? 市民们想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a statement? People want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.77,0:37:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 企鹅人不该被打扰的! - 这是公共场所!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Penguin's not to be disturbed! - It's a public place!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.06,0:37:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 走开 现在 快走开 - 新闻舆论的自由!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walk. Now. Move. - Freedom of the press!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.69,0:37:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.36,0:37:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么样的想法 让你想寻找你的根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the freedom to rediscover your roots
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.20,0:37:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掺杂尊严和隐私?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with dignity and privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅是你私人的朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the Penguin a personal friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.87,0:37:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是整个城市的私人朋友 只要有着一颗心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a personal friend of the whole city so have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让法规休息一下 这是圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the Constitution a rest. It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.09,0:38:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"红三角马戏团表演声势浩大 还有凶猛的狮子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Red Triangle Circus put on a swell show with fierce lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"马戏团表演将为期两周 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Circus returns for a two-week .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.77,0:38:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"小孩会喜欢的 ."\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Kids will love ."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.15,0:38:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是掺有马铃薯的奶油汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's vichyssoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.87,0:38:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷了才好喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's supposed to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"马戏团回来 又带着怪异的表演 并不适合小孩 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Circus is back with a freak show may not be suitable for kids
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.54,0:38:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,," 特写一位狮子头女士 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" featuring a poodle lady
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.88,0:38:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,," 世界最胖的人 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" the world's fattest man
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.13,0:38:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,," 水上鸟男孩"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" and Aquatic Bird Boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.38,0:39:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何决心证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you determined to prove
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.18,0:39:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个企鹅人所言不实?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this Penguin is not what he seems?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.47,0:39:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定得当全城唯一的"人兽"吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must you be the only lonely "man-beast" in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.81,0:39:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"马戏团昨天收起帐篷 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The circus folded its tents yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.98,0:39:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,," 在数个城镇发生无数儿童失踪案件后"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" after reports of missing children in several towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"警方已关闭红三角表演场"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Police have closed down the Red Triangle fairgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.49,0:39:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"然而 至少有一名畸型表演者 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"However at least one freak-show performer vanished before
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.66,0:39:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,," 在接受侦讯前失踪了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" he could be questioned."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.58,0:39:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你觉得好多了 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.72,0:39:35.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我觉得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually I feel worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.24,0:39:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何还在外面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why're you still out?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.82,0:39:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在关心那个英雄般怪异的企鹅人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you concerned about that strange heroic Penguin person?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.46,0:40:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他知道他父母是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he knows who his parents are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.67,0:40:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他另有所图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.73,0:42:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Penguin .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.06,0:42:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅是鸟类却不会飞!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A penguin is a bird that cannot fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.40,0:42:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.99,0:42:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有名字!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.49,0:42:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥兹瓦.卡伯波特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oswald Cobblepot!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从未和他们生活在一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never be able to settle with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.42,0:42:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.67,0:42:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他们"第一流"的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was their "Number-One"" son
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.26,0:42:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他们待我却像二流的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they treated me like number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.76,0:42:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但人类的天性是害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's human nature to fear
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.69,0:42:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇特的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.10,0:42:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.94,0:42:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I held my
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.61,0:42:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小孩玩的拨浪鼓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiffany baby rattle
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.61,0:42:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以带有光泽的蹼状手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a shiny flipper
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.12,0:42:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而非五只圆胖的手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of five chubby digits
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们吓到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.63,0:43:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我原谅他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.13,0:43:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"企鹅人原谅父母了!" "我对自己与世界都感到平和!"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Penguin forgives parents!", "I'm at peace with myself and the world!"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.22,0:43:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"只要有心 便不需要手"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Don't need hands as long as you got heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.93,0:43:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我的心充满爱 我觉得有五呎高"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My heart is filled with love. I feel five feet tall."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.22,0:43:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他像只变成王子的青蛙 - 不 他更像只企鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's like a frog that became a prince. - No he's more like a penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.82,0:43:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 漂亮的小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now now pretty little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.57,0:43:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.41,0:43:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢高大强壮 而且 勇于展现力量对付体型小他一半的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love a big strong man who's not afraid to show it with someone half his size.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.63,0:43:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温柔点 这是我的第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gentle it's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.18,0:43:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踢-踏-拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tic-tac-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.11,0:43:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我 妳使自己容易受害 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make it easy don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.86,0:44:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是等着蝙蝠侠来救妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always waiting for some Batman to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.49,0:44:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是猫女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Catwoman
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.29,0:44:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我怒吼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hear me roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你喝咖啡 但我的助理正在休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd offer you coffee but my assistant is using her vacation time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.52,0:44:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好时机 反正过年之前 除了盗贼以外 大家都想放松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good time. Everyone but the bandits'll be slacking off till after the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.90,0:44:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定是否喜欢你的推论 布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I like the inference.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.15,0:44:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 麦斯 我不觉得我有做推论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't realize I made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.83,0:44:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在促销发电厂计划 因为将来花费会更高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pushing this power plant now because it'll cost more later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省一百万等于赚一百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A million saved is a million earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.55,0:44:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了一份报告 也许你想看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I commissioned this report. Take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.76,0:44:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯 重点是高谭市已供电过量 我确信你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham City has a power surplus. I'm sure you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.02,0:44:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My question is:
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.52,0:45:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的目的为何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.77,0:45:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"供电过量?" 布鲁斯 你该惭愧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Power surplus?" Bruce shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.27,0:45:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事 电力再多都不为过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No such thing. One can never have too much power.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.86,0:45:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的生命若有何意义 那就是意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my life has a meaning that's the meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.83,0:45:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将与你唱反调 我已和市长谈过 我们看法一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fight you. I've already spoken to the mayor and we agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.08,0:45:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市长多如过江之鲫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayors come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.79,0:45:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贵族容易没落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue bloods tire easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.96,0:45:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为能和拳王许瑞克打上15回合吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you go 15 rounds with Muhammad Shreck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.67,0:45:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来得拭目以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.97,0:45:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我没有卡伯波特 那种犯罪集团首领的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I don't have a crime boss like Cobblepot in my corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.09,0:45:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"犯罪集团首领?" 证明你知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Crime boss?" Shows what you know
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"天之骄子先生"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mr. To-The-Manor-Born-With-A-Silver-Spoon."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.52,0:45:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥兹瓦是高谭市的新英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oswald is Gotham's new golden boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.06,0:45:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他父母若未嫌弃他 你们俩或许会是同学室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If his parents hadn't 86'ed him you'd have been bunkies at prep school.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.82,0:45:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥兹瓦控制红三角帮 我还无法证明 但我们俩...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He controls the Red Triangle Gang. I can't prove it yet but we both...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.03,0:45:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩 我不允许办公室内有揭人隐私之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll not stand for mud-slinging here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的助理若在此 早已护送你出去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my assistant was here she'd have already escorted you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到任何他想去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anywhere he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.12,0:45:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是夜总会 洞穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preferably some nightspot grotto
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:45:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.50,0:46:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐密的藏身处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}secluded hideaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.34,0:46:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好西装 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.85,0:46:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 瑟琳娜　\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina. Selina. 
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.56,0:46:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的名字 百万麦斯 别念太多 否则我要你买个新的赔我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my name don't wear it out or I'll make you buy me a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.53,0:46:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 这是布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Bruce
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.57,0:46:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.45,0:46:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 我们见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.08,0:46:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.24,0:46:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 抱歉 我误以为自己是别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No I'm sorry. I mistook me for somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.92,0:46:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你意思是... "误认我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean "mistook me."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.38,0:46:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我误以为我 对 我不是那么说的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.05,0:46:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我想不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.05,0:46:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.55,0:46:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳在滑雪坡上受伤了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hurt yourself on that ski slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.06,0:46:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此妳才缩短假期回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you cut short your vacation? Came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.69,0:46:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很模糊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.61,0:46:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 未完全失去记忆 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not complete amnesia. 
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.51,0:47:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得玛丽.玛格丽特修女在教堂呕吐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember Sister Mary Margaret puking in church
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而贝西.莱利说那是害喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Betsy saying it was morning sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.71,0:47:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也记得有次上学 忘了穿内裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the time I forgot to wear my underpants to school
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.96,0:47:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而注意到的男孩 名叫瑞奇.佛莱伯格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the name of the boy who noticed was Ricky Friedburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.80,0:47:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.72,0:47:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But last night
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.43,0:47:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全模糊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}complete blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.93,0:47:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不可思议吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't you just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.98,0:47:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜 拜托妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.48,0:47:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送韦恩先生出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}show out Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.44,0:47:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐意之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.32,0:47:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的外套 韦恩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your coat Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.09,0:47:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不像是那种和许瑞克做生意的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem like the type who does business with Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.43,0:47:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不像是那种会听命于他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You don't seem like the type to take orders from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.27,0:47:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's a
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.94,0:47:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iong story.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.27,0:48:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以腾出点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could free up some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.19,0:48:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我记下了 - 我很想听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm listed. - I'm tempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.45,0:48:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.95,0:48:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.70,0:48:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸 你相信她说的话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You buy that blurry business?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.87,0:48:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.37,0:48:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何事我都不讶异 奇普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing surprises me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.79,0:48:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了你过世的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except your late mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.21,0:48:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会想到瑟琳娜竟有堪受毁坏的脑袋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd have thought Selina had a brain to damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.21,0:48:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最坏结果吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bottom line?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.05,0:48:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她企图勒索我 我将她推出更高的窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tries to blackmail me I'll drop her out of a higher window.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.22,0:48:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meantime
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.47,0:48:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有更重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got badder fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.41,0:48:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥兹瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oswald
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.32,0:48:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.01,0:49:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在家吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're home?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.85,0:49:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.86,0:49:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你众多的家人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your extended family?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.19,0:49:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有家庭真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.61,0:49:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在宁可不受打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather not be disturbed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.12,0:49:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下楼 奥兹瓦 我要给你一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on downstairs Oswald. I have a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.20,0:49:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.23,0:49:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.24,0:49:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别偷看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.66,0:50:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会破坏惊喜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.44,0:50:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 奉受是个重担 我很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adulation is a cross to bear. God knows I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.78,0:50:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在进步的道路上 有人必须被取代的 市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But someone's got to supplant our standing in the way of progress Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.58,0:50:35.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别否认 卡伯波特先生 你有那种魔力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't deny it Mr. Cobblepot you've got the magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.29,0:50:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的非凡魅力远胜过我们 下来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your charisma's bigger than both of us. Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.96,0:50:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.30,0:50:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.55,0:50:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯 十一月才选举 现在是十二月底耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elections happen in November. It's late December.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.89,0:50:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.39,0:50:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你见见珍和乔希... 我的形象顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to meet Jen and Josh my image consultants.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.56,0:50:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.90,0:50:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拾回你天生的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reclaim your birthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.53,0:51:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是珍 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.37,0:51:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我看看 首先我要做的是 将这些小手套戴在你手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay let's see. What I'd like to do first is put these gloves on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.21,0:51:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的研究显示 我们的选民喜欢手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our research tells us that voters like fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.38,0:51:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此 若将它藏起来 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if we were to just lose this .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.55,0:51:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们改天再戴好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do it another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.22,0:51:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下水道没多少能反光的平面 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a lot of reflective surfaces in the sewer huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.07,0:51:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 有可能更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.74,0:51:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的鼻子可能血流不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My nose could be gushing blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.87,0:51:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的鼻子可能 你的意思是说 ?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.92,0:51:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人回去工作!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.76,0:51:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们造就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.93,0:52:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位市长!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.94,0:52:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 我们错过正常排定的选举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right we missed the regular election
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.11,0:52:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但当选官员可以改选 弹劾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but elected officials can be recalled impeached
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.95,0:52:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罢黜.像尼克松 艾格纽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given the boot. Look at Nixon Agnew.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.78,0:52:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再想想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then think of you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.45,0:52:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥兹瓦.卡伯波特填补其位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oswald Cobblepot filling the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.95,0:52:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒想填补她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to fill her void.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.29,0:52:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要签名 以促成改选 那些我能供应 奥兹瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need signatures to overturn the ballot. I can supply those.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.13,0:52:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 教她我的法国鳍把戏 - 奥兹瓦 我们还需要一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Teach her my French flipper trick. - We need one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.43,0:52:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一块踏板吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A platform?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.31,0:52:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止环球温室效应 开始环球冷却效应 使世界成为巨大的冰箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop global warming. Start global cooling. Make the world an icebox.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.15,0:52:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢 但要改选市长 需要一个触媒 导火线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it. But to get the mayor recalled we must have a catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.99,0:52:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你做得很好 卡伯波特市长"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're doing great Mayor Cobblepot."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.95,0:52:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你的餐桌准备好了 卡伯波特市长"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Your table is ready Mayor Cobblepot."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.45,0:52:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我需要你 奥兹瓦 我现在就需要你!"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"l need you Oswald. I need you now! "
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.13,0:53:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"那是我见过最大的伞"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"That's the biggest parasol I've ever seen."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.63,0:53:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会发生东京湾意外 或雷斯塔格大火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon an incident like the Gulf of Tonkin or the Reichstag fire .
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.35,0:53:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我在上面的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want my old friends up there
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.02,0:53:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使市长发狂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to drive the mayor into a foaming frenzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 正是 - 听来很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Exactly. - Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.53,0:53:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.45,0:53:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能分神 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mustn't get sidetracked Maxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.54,0:53:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有我的正事要办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have my own things to tend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.04,0:53:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"想转移话题吗?" 奥兹瓦 打从你父母草率抛弃你到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sidetracked?" This is your chance to fulfill your destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你达成天命的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your parents carelessly discarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.22,0:53:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指重拾我天生的权利?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reclaim my birthright you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.47,0:53:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试想身为市长后 你将得到媒体的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine as mayor you have the ear of the media
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.72,0:53:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企业大亨将尊重你的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}access to the captains of industry
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.14,0:53:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无限制的嬉闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unlimited poontang.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.65,0:53:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的条件很诱人 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drive a hard bargain Maxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.41,0:54:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我就当市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right I'll be mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.25,0:54:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧吧 宝贝 烧吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn baby burn!
