Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.41,0:56:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You poor guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.07,0:57:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手枪和私处老是搞不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always confusing your pistols with your privates.
