Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.54,0:57:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,薪水太高了 滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're overpaid. Hit the road.
