Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.86,0:58:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多直接的方法啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.02,0:58:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欣赏一个戴面具的人能如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire that in a man with a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.66,0:58:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真的以为你会赢吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't really think you'll win do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.21,0:58:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世事多变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.90,0:59:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先看到她的 得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw her first. Got to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.72,1:00:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能如此?我是个女人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you? I'm a woman!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.72,1:00:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.99,1:00:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所说 我是个女人 不能让人视为理所当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was saying I'm a woman and can't be taken for granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.58,1:00:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生无常 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's a bitch now so am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.85,1:00:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.69,1:00:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠背后是什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the man behind the bat?
