Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那不是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No that's not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.12,1:01:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.48,1:01:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被猫担架救了一条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saved by Kitty Litter.
