Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.84,1:01:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我拿消毒软膏来 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring me some antiseptic ointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.60,1:01:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了 会痛吗 主人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming. Are you in pain sir?
