Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.93,1:03:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳是模范能得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're the hottest young person
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.60,1:03:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最热情的年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a role model could have.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.27,1:03:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.31,1:03:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴个徽章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wear a button.
