Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.29,1:03:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的会喜欢候选市长这种事 非关权力 而是接触人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mayor stuff is not about power it's about reaching out to people
