Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.33,1:04:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里真冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's chilly in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.33,1:04:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会使妳温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll warm you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.04,1:04:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静 奥兹瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down Oswald.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.88,1:04:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk.
