Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.71,1:04:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 妳是登记投票人吗? 我是市长候选人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perchance are you a registered voter? I'm a mayoral prospect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.76,1:04:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天来只有一个目的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have but one pet cause today!.
