Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.05,1:04:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 又是他 没问题 他已经完了 妳看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh him again. No bother. He's already history. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.85,1:05:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要拆开他的蝙蝠车 将它变成活动氢弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll disassemble his Batmobile and turn it into an H-bomb on wheels.
