Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要消灭蝙蝠侠 首先得将他变成他最痛恨的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To destroy Batman we must first turn him into what he hates the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.62,1:05:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是... 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Namely us.
