Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.97,1:05:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许妳只是个心理不平衡的名媛 想报复父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're a screwed-up sorority chick getting back at her daddy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.31,1:05:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只因她年满16岁时 没帮她买匹小马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for not buying her that pony when she turned sweet-sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.09,1:05:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice birdie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.94,1:06:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.86,1:06:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好猫　好猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.12,1:06:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠伤了我的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batman napaimed my arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我才开始满意自己时 就害我跌落谷底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knocked me off a buiiding just when I started to feel good about myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.96,1:06:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要在他坠落时 扮演重要角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to play an integral part in his degradation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.30,1:06:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划正在形成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pian is forming.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.06,1:06:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.74,1:06:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到要害蝙蝠侠 就令我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thought of busting Batman makes me feei all
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.08,1:06:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肮脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.25,1:07:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我就在这儿 给自己洗个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'll just give myseif a bath right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.22,1:07:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我质疑市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I challenge the mayor
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.27,1:07:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明晚在高谭广场要重新点燃圣诞树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to re-light the Christmas tree in Gotham Plaza tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.27,1:07:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人 我们该不该换个频道 看些高级节目呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir shaii we change the channei to a program with some dignity and ciass?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.61,1:07:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱的联机怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Love Connection perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.28,1:07:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我对市长没信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not that I have any faith in the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.58,1:07:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望和祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I hope and pray
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.79,1:07:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Batman
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.42,1:07:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在场并维护和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be present to preserve the peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.59,1:07:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.30,1:07:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何你要这样做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.47,1:07:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.81,1:07:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我不是想吓妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.31,1:08:00.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓我?我是自己吓到而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scare me? I was just scaring myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为何 但\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see how but .
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.14,1:08:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴在远离许瑞克的真实世界中见到妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's nice to see you in the real world away from Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.98,1:08:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴是在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's nice to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.02,1:08:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.49,1:08:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳看起来有点忧郁或者有心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you have the holiday blues or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.49,1:08:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥 这几天的新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy the news these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.54,1:08:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪怪的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.29,1:08:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听电视上说"猫女重140磅"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard on TV that Catwoman weighs 140 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.55,1:08:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人晚上睡饱了没事干?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do these hacks sleep at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.88,1:08:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还更扯 居然说"蝙蝠侠炸的"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not even accurate. "Batman blows it"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.01,1:08:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很可能独自救了百万人的生命财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He probabiy saved miliions in property damage alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.35,1:08:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要去参加重燃圣诞树典礼吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to the re-lighting of the tree are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.23,1:08:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要自找没趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be caught dead there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.74,1:08:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是今晚这寒冷城镇最热闹的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's going to be a hot time in the cold town tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.07,1:08:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳属于黑暗一类的 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got kind of a dark side don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.54,1:09:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有比你更黑暗的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No darker than yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.25,1:09:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳何不来我那儿 一起在电视前看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come over and we can watch it on TV?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.92,1:09:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞树点亮典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tree-lighting ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.38,1:09:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我今晚还有别处要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I have to be somewhere tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.10,1:09:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午五点来我家晚餐 如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about coming for dinner at five?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.73,1:09:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者六点如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say six?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.23,1:09:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 五点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.10,1:09:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就五点 妳和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five. You and me.
