Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.30,1:09:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不但会点亮圣诞树 我还是个女演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't just iight trees. I'm an actress as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.81,1:09:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西? 照像机还是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that thing? A camera or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.39,1:09:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫"好东西!"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say "Cheese! "
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.48,1:10:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.16,1:10:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 阿佛瑞德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Aifred.
