Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.75,1:10:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但"富有单身汉"不觉得无聊吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but doesn't the "gold-plated-bacheior" bit get a little stale?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.76,1:10:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜和"寂寞秘书"一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot like the "lonely-secretary" syndrome I guess.
