Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.95,1:10:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有女朋友吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.37,1:10:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.79,1:10:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 你是说 认真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean as in serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.12,1:10:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 有过一个 没再交往了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Had one didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.38,1:10:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了什么差错? 慢着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What went wrong? Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.71,1:10:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know!
