Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.97,1:11:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两个事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two truths
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.81,1:11:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.48,1:11:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她无法调和二者 因为我也无法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had troubie reconciiing them because I had trouble
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调和二者 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reconciiing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.82,1:11:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 维基认为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicki thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.16,1:11:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维基?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicki?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.33,1:11:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,溜冰好手或空姐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ice skater or stewardess?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.33,1:11:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 她是个摄影记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No she was a photojournalist.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.92,1:11:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对你双重性的困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was Vicki right about your
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.09,1:11:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维基的看法对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}difficulty with duality?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.93,1:11:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.10,1:11:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我若说是 那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I say yes then
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.85,1:11:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳会以为我是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll think of me as a
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.19,1:11:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像泰德.邦迪的杀人狂 而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Norman Bates a Ted Bundy type and .
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.37,1:11:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不肯让我吻妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might not let me kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.21,1:12:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会令人失望的 一向是所谓的正常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the so-called normai guys who always let you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.71,1:12:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂人从未吓到我 至少他们执着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sickos never scare me. At ieast they're committed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.01,1:12:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.52,1:12:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither can i.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.89,1:12:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是特别报导 冰雪公主被绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a special bulletin. The Ice Princess has been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.61,1:12:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈登署长 你能证实 蝙蝠侠涉嫌绑架的传闻吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you confirm reports of Batman's suspected involvement in the abduction?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.86,1:13:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个证据纯粹是间接的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evidence is purely circumstantial.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.99,1:13:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它沾了血迹 是在失踪女孩的更衣室找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was found stained with blood in the missing girl's dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.17,1:13:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我得走了 - 不 是我 这是你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must go. - No it's your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.00,1:13:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 坐一下 轻松点 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoid on. Just sit for a second and reiax. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.31,1:13:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿佛瑞德 我得到广场去 我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go to the piaza.
