Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.36,1:27:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市长有计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did the mayor have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.53,1:27:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.11,1:27:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他依赖一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He relied on a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.87,1:27:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.20,1:27:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个服装怪异的定时炸弹 .\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ticking time-bomb of a costumed freak .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.54,1:27:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们主要关切的是这个可怕的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our prime concern is this ghastiy grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.21,1:27:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也别忘了修蝙蝠车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let's not forget about repairing the Batmobiie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.63,1:28:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得考虑安全问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's security to consider.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.89,1:28:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能将它任意送到一个修车厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just take it to any oid body shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.98,1:28:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.31,1:28:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁让维基.维尔进蝙蝠洞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who let Vicki Vaie into the Batcave?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.65,1:28:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在工作 一转身 她便在那里:"嗨 维基 请进"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working I turn around and there she is. "Hi Vick. Come on in."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.41,1:28:25.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了吗? - 我想我走楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready? - I'll take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.40,1:28:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们问我 我是否为个人荣耀上场?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ask am I up here for personal glory?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.86,1:28:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.88,1:29:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我渴望重拾的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The glory that I yearn to recapture
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.89,1:29:13.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是高谭市的荣耀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the glory of Gotham!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.16,1:29:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要如何达成?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can this be accomplished?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.87,1:29:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.42,1:29:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都很关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're all concerned.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.92,1:29:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.76,1:29:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会对付高谭市那些 尖叫的 可怜的白痴市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of the squealing wretched pinhead puppets of Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.65,1:29:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.61,1:30:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须承认 我玩弄这个臭城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must admit I played this stinking city
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.78,1:30:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于股掌之间! 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a harp from hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.62,1:30:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must admit
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.20,1:30:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我玩弄这个臭城市于股掌之间! 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I played this stinking city like a harp from hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.10,1:31:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么总有人带着蛋和蕃茄参加演说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is there aiways someone who brings eggs and tomatoes to a speech?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.01,1:31:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.05,1:32:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.72,1:32:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.41,1:32:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.74,1:32:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒的演说 奥兹瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great speech Oswaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.87,1:32:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不叫奥兹瓦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is not Oswaid!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.42,1:32:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是企鹅!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's Penguin!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.21,1:32:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是人类!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a human being!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.59,1:32:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个冷血动物!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an animal. Cold-blooded!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.39,1:32:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空调加强点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crank the A.C.!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.18,1:32:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名单呢?将名字送上来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are my lists? Bring me the names!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.02,1:32:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.77,1:32:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是高谭市长子们的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the names of the first-born sons of Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.19,1:32:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.28,1:32:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而和我一样 可怕的命运在等着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like me a terribie fate waits for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.12,1:33:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚 当他们的父母狂欢时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight while their parents party
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们将作梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll be dreaming away
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.21,1:33:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们的摇篮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in their safe cribs
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.54,1:33:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们的软床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their soft beds
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.80,1:33:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们将劫走他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll snatch them
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.13,1:33:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他们到下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}carry them into the sewer
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.30,1:33:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将他们丢进深黑的水底坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and toss them into a deep dark watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.64,1:33:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguin?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.56,1:33:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死熟睡儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiiiing sieeping children
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.15,1:33:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岂不是有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't that a littie .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.16,1:33:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.71,1:33:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,韦恩先生 提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reminder.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.22,1:33:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚那个可恶的许瑞克先生 要举办讨厌的派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight is that ioathsome party hosted by the odious Mr. Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.56,1:33:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能严正回绝吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we RSVP in the resoundingiy negative?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.10,1:34:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.56,1:34:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.15,1:34:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜.凯尔可能会在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina Kyie might be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.51,1:34:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真出色的服装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ingenious costume.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.68,1:34:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来猜猜看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.35,1:34:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基金会的好人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust-fund goody-goody?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.69,1:34:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉很好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeiing good?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.11,1:34:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你差点使一个怪物当上高谭市长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost made a monster the mayor of Gotham City.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.95,1:34:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是本市之光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the light of this city
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.62,1:34:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是它卑劣 疯狂的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am its mean twisted soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.54,1:34:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁当市长有关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter who's mayor?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.37,1:34:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it does to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.96,1:34:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.42,1:35:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 昨天很抱歉 我得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about yesterday but I had
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.97,1:35:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去处理一大笔生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a pretty big deal come through. Fall through actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.59,1:35:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我得回家去喂我的猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's okay. I had to go home and feed my cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.44,1:35:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不伤感情啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No hard feelings then?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.61,1:35:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actuaiiy
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.16,1:36:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是半伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}semi-hard I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.29,1:36:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寝具部有个大而舒适的双人床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a big comfy California King over in Bedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们何不 .\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.14,1:36:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉舞会服装吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off our costumes?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.52,1:36:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已厌倦戴面具了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of wearing masks.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.52,1:36:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.19,1:36:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我问妳一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.20,1:36:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳今晚为何而来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you come tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.53,1:36:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你先说 - 来看妳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You first. - To see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.99,1:36:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.66,1:36:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿我能说同样的话 但我是为了麦斯来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I couid say the same but I came for Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.88,1:36:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳的意思是妳 .\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mean you .
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.84,1:36:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会妳和麦斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you and Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.68,1:36:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈 我和麦斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.69,1:36:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这个和麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This and Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.69,1:37:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 别告诉我杀死麦斯无法解决一切 因为那一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me killing Max won't solve anything because it will.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.91,1:37:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不厌倦这虚伪的强盗大亨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you tired of this sanctimonious robber baron
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.41,1:37:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是获胜 他不该被埋在六呎以下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming out on top when he should be six feet under?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.42,1:37:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妳或许和妳老板之间有很多问题 但妳以为妳是谁啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have problems with your boss but who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.59,1:37:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不知道了 布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know anymore Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.36,1:37:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,檞寄生下的吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kiss under the mistietoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.78,1:37:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"妳若吃檞寄生会致命"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mistietoe can be deadly if you eat it."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.04,1:37:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你若认真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a kiss can be even deadlier
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.79,1:37:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个吻会更致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.64,1:38:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.98,1:38:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是否意味我们得开始打斗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean we have to start fighting?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.56,1:38:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到外面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.02,1:38:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸　儿子 你没事吧?　- 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.29,1:38:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没邀请我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't invite me
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.46,1:39:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我不请自来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I crashed!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.67,1:39:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.84,1:39:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我的部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now my troops
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.92,1:39:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在全城搜寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are fanning out across town
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.43,1:39:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的孩子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your children!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.55,1:39:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.72,1:39:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们的长子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your first-born sons!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.56,1:39:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们使他无助在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones you left defenseless at home
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.73,1:39:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好让自己能打扮得像傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you could dress up like jerks
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.15,1:39:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝着果汁和跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get juiced and dance
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.07,1:39:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏透了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}badly!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.99,1:39:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲自前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've personally come
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.58,1:39:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为抓高谭市最喜爱的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for Gotham's favorite son
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.17,1:39:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇普.许瑞克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chip Shreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.17,1:39:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走 你这个大白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming with me you Great White Dope
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.84,1:39:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以便死在下面的下水道中!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to die way down in the sewer!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.84,1:39:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别抓奇普 你若有丝毫人 就抓我代替吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Chip. if you have any human feeiing take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.93,1:39:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有 因此 不行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't. So no!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.10,1:39:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才是你要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.48,1:39:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操纵和背叛你的 不是麦斯.许克吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it Max Shreck who manipuiated and betrayed you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.53,1:40:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是麦斯 而非奇普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it Max not Chip
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.20,1:40:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要看到他在下水道中淹死的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you want to see immersed to his eyeballs in raw sewage?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.71,1:40:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你说的有理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.79,1:40:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就暂时让这小子活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let the littie prince live for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.80,1:40:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进鸭子里去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.50,1:40:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to be good
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.42,1:40:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在高谭市最有希望的作物成熟前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to cut down a whoie crop of Gotham's most promising
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.26,1:40:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将它们砍断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before their prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.26,1:40:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在问我 如何引诱他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ask me how do I lure them in?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.98,1:41:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点"杂耍企鹅"把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A littie "Pied Penguin" action.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.94,1:41:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以看着他们沈入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you get to watch them sink
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.28,1:41:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a deep puddle
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.28,1:41:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的工业副产品中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of your industrial by-products.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.66,1:41:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.99,1:41:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再加入他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you join them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.49,1:41:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点将那些孩子装好 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up and get those kids loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.68,1:42:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边走 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right this way kiddies.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.22,1:42:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.20,1:42:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有小孩在哪呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where are all the children?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.54,1:42:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"亲爱的企鹅:"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Penguin:
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.08,1:42:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"小孩们懊悔不克参加"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The chiidren regret they're unabie to attend.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.75,1:42:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"蝙蝠侠!"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Batman! "
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.61,1:42:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲爱的企鹅们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear penguins
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.78,1:42:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们站在一个大关键点上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we stand on a great threshold!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.74,1:43:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕是正常的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's okay to be scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.41,1:43:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有许多人将回不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of you won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.29,1:43:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢蝙蝠侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to Batman
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.75,1:43:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惩罚所有神的子民的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the time has come
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.79,1:43:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来临了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to punish all God's chiidren!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.71,1:43:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长子 次子 三子和四子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First-second-third-and fourth-born!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.39,1:43:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何要有偏见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why be biased?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.22,1:43:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男的和女的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Male and female!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.64,1:43:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 男女平等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell the sexes are equal
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.81,1:43:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将他们的性感带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with their erogenous zones
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.23,1:43:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸向高空!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}blown sky-high!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.90,1:43:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forward
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.41,1:43:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前进!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}march!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.99,1:43:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解放高谭市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The liberation of Gotham
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.33,1:43:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has begun!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.97,1:44:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅们在地面上活动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The penguins are moving above ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.67,1:44:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguin army
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.33,1:44:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近发射目的地... 高谭广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}approaching launch destination at Gotham Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.01,1:45:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距发射一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute until ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.68,1:45:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不尊重我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wouldn't put me on a pedestal
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.14,1:45:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就让他们送命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'm laying them on a slab!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.81,1:45:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅似乎在高谭广场集结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penguins seem to be converging on Gotham Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.80,1:45:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距发射三十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds until ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.89,1:45:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射后估计死亡人数:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimated casualties after launch:
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.56,1:45:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100,000 people.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.56,1:45:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,企鹅们已抵达高谭广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The penguins have reached Gotham Square.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.76,1:46:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距发射十五秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen seconds to ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.34,1:46:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready when you are sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.85,1:46:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10 9 8 7\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10-9-8-7
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.44,1:46:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 让他们转向 是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's turn them around.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.71,1:46:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.96,1:46:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讯号被干扰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something has jammed the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.31,1:46:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们似乎转向了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to be turning around.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.68,1:47:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来 还有某种东西往这边来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is also something coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.60,1:47:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常大 非常快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very large. Very fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.87,1:47:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.47,1:47:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进入讯号中心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm homing in on the signal's origin.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.85,1:49:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你嫉妒我是个纯种怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're jealous because I'm a genuine freak
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.27,1:49:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你得戴着面具!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you have to wear a mask!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.78,1:49:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.03,1:49:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最重要的是: 谁拿着雨伞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what it all comes down to is: Who's holding the umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.48,1:49:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My babies!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.56,1:51:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道妳想要什么 但只要我花一点功夫 就能弄到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you want but I can get it with a minimum of fuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.07,1:51:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.57,1:51:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewels.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.86,1:51:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很大一串的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very big ball of string.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.33,1:51:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的血 麦斯 我的血?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your blood Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.20,1:51:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在办公室捐过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave at the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.21,1:51:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有半品脱 我要的是半加仑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A half-pint. I'm taiking gallons.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.75,1:51:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来谈条件!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make a deal!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.38,1:52:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我的血 我能为妳做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other than my blood what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.59,1:52:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 麦斯 以死还死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry Max. A die for a die.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.10,1:52:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不只在救一条命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not just saving a life...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.61,1:52:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是在救 闭嘴 你要去坐牢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. You're going to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.36,1:52:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别天真了 法律对像他这样的人 或我们 都莫可奈何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be naive. The law doesn't apply to people like him or us.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.20,1:52:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二者皆非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong on both counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.88,1:52:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何要如此做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.05,1:52:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将他交给警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just take him to the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.81,1:52:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we can go home
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.73,1:52:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}together.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.94,1:52:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selina
